  <h4 data-rte-preserve-empty="true">We Are Thrilled to Announce Two Major Wins!</h4><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Because of Josclyn’s powerful advocacy and the overwhelming support of our network, Path to Permanency took home two incredible honors:</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>2nd Place Prize ($8,000)</strong></p></li><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>The Community Vote Award ($1,000)</strong></p></li></ul><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="_13-wL _2jbIK">This critical funding will be injected directly into our programs, allowing us to expand our reach and deepen our impact.&nbsp; We won this specifically because of <strong>YOU </strong>with a record-breaking 3,400 votes! Your massive virtual voter turnout proved that our community is engaged, vocal, and ready to stand up for children navigating the foster care system.</p><h4 data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Keep the Momentum Going</h4><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="_13-wL _2jbIK">While we pause to celebrate these victories, the real work continues. We must carry last night's energy directly to our local government.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="_13-wL _2jbIK">Reach out today to find how you can get involved!</p>


  













  
    
    
      
      




